<% content_for(:page_bg_class, "admin-only bg-blue-100") %>
<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl <%= DomainTheme.bg_class_for(:event_registrations) %> border-primary/10 rounded-2xl border p-6 shadow-sm">
  <div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap justify-start gap-2">
    <% back_label, back_path = import_back_link %>
    <%= link_to "← #{back_label}", back_path, class: "text-sm #{eyebrow_link_class} px-2 py-1" %>
  </div>

  <h1 class="text-primary mb-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
    Import registrants
  </h1>
  <p class="mb-4 text-gray-600">
    Upload a CSV of people who registered for or attended an event — live or on-demand, training or not —
    and we'll add each one as a registration, just as if they'd registered. People, organizations, and
    addresses already in the portal are matched, not duplicated. No emails are sent, and you'll preview
    everything before anything is saved.
  </p>
  <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
    Required: <span class="font-medium">FirstName</span> and <span class="font-medium">LastName</span>.
    Every other column is optional — leave out what you don't have. Export your spreadsheet as a .csv first.
  </p>
  <details class="mb-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white text-sm text-gray-600">
    <summary class="cursor-pointer px-4 py-2 font-medium text-gray-700">Columns we read</summary>
    <dl class="space-y-2 px-4 pb-4">
      <% [
        [ "Person", "EMail, Nickname, Pronouns, SecondaryEmail. Without an email we match by name at the " \
                    "row's organization, then by a name only one person has; a new email-less person gets a " \
                    "placeholder like 1@example.com." ],
        [ "Status", "Status — Attended, Incomplete attendance, Registered, No show, or Cancelled. Blank means " \
                    "Attended. Day 1 … Day 5 (Yes/No) record which days they came; Attended marks every day. " \
                    "RegisteredOn sets the registration date." ],
        [ "Organization", "Organization, Position, OrganizationWebsite, OrganizationType, and the organization's " \
                          "address: OrganizationStreet, OrganizationCity, OrganizationState, OrganizationZip, OrganizationCountry." ],
        [ "Contact", "Street, City, State, Zip, Country, AddressType (Work/Personal), Phone, PhoneType (Work/Personal)." ],
        [ "Sectors & ages", "PrimarySector, AdditionalSectors, PrimaryAgeGroup, AdditionalAgeGroups — names as the " \
                            "registration form lists them; separate several with commas." ],
        [ "CE", "CE (Yes/No), LicenseType, LicenseNumber, LicenseState, LicenseExpires." ],
        [ "Money", "Scholarship (amount awarded), AmountPaid, PaymentType (cash, check, or card), CheckNumber for " \
                   "checks. A paying row's unpaid remainder is comped with a discount so it reads as paid." ],
        [ "Follow-up", "SomeoneElseWillPay, InvoiceRequested, W9Requested (Yes/No); PostSurveyCompleted and " \
                       "CertificateSent (a date, or Yes for the event's last day)." ]
      ].each do |group, columns| %>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-medium text-gray-800"><%= group %></dt>
          <dd><%= columns %></dd>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </dl>
  </details>
  <div class="rounded bg-white p-6">
    <% if flash.now[:alert].present? %>
      <div class="mb-4 rounded border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-red-700">
        <%= flash.now[:alert] %>
      </div>
    <% end %>

    <%= form_with url: event_registration_import_path, method: :post, multipart: true do |f| %>
      <%= hidden_field_tag :return_to, params[:return_to].presence %>
      <div class="mb-4">
        <%= f.label :event_id, "Event", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1" %>
        <%= f.select :event_id,
                     options_from_collection_for_select(@events, :id, :time_title, @event&.id),
                     { prompt: "Choose an event…" },
                     class: "block w-full text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-blue-200 p-2" %>
      </div>
      <div class="mb-4">
        <%= f.label :file, "CSV file", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1" %>
        <%= f.file_field :file, accept: ".csv,text/csv",
                         class: "block w-full text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg cursor-pointer focus:outline-none p-2" %>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <%= f.submit "Preview import", class: button_classes(:primary_outline, extra: "bg-blue-100") %>
        <%= link_to "Cancel", back_path,
                    class: button_classes(:secondary_outline) %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
